      <h1 class="h2 color-heading md:max-w-80% xl:max-w-95% md:m-auto">Kale Chia Smoothie</h1>
      
        <div class="des copy text-dark-gray-200 mt-5px md:mt-10px lg:mt-15px">
          <h5>Healthy, creamy and delicious! Add the chia seeds at the end to keep a little of the texture from the seeds. Makes 750ml</h5>
        </div>
      
      
