          <div class="mb-20px lg:mb-30px xl:mb-40px">
            <div class="copy max-w-780px m-auto">
              <div class="panel panel-text-two-columns w-skin-01 bg-light-gray-700 mb-15px md:mb-20px lg:mb-30px xl:mb-40px">
<div class="list">
<div class="item">
<h4 class="text-dark-red">Ingredients</h4>
</div>
<div class="item">
<ul>
<li>1 cup (150g) fresh pineapple pieces</li>
<li>2 kiwi fruit, halved *</li>
<li>1 stalk of kale</li>
<li>1 ripe avocado, halved, stone and skin discarded</li>
<li>200g natural Greek Style yoghurt</li>
<li>½ cup (125ml) orange juice</li>
<li>several small ice cubes (about ¼ cup)</li>
<li>1 tbs fresh mint leaves</li>
<li>2 tbs chia seeds</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="panel panel-text-two-columns w-skin-02 border border-light-gray-200 mb-20px lg:mb-30px xl:mb-40px">
<div class="list">
<div class="item">
<h4 class="text-dark-red">Method</h4>
</div>
<div class="item">
<ol>
<li class="w-full">For best results use a KitchenAid® Diamond Blender.</li>
<li>Add the pineapple, kale, kiwi, avocado, yoghurt, orange juice, ice and mint to the blender.</li>
<li>Select Liquify and blend for 30 seconds or until smooth. Add the chia seeds pulse 2-3 times.</li>
<li>Pour into glasses and serve immediately.</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<h4 class="text-dark-red">Tips</h4>
<ul>
<li>The skin can be left on the kiwi fruit if desired.</li>
</ul>
              
            </div>
          </div>
        
